WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.434 --> 00:00:03.084
Lesson three. Colours!

2
00:00:04.027 --> 00:00:11.260
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.389
Coco, look! A rainbow!

4
00:00:14.439 --> 00:00:18.189
Wow! So many colours! Let's learn!

5
00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:23.019
Red! Say it with me. Red!

6
00:00:26.957 --> 00:00:30.323
Blue! Say it with me. Blue!

7
00:00:34.321 --> 00:00:37.721
Yellow! Say it with me. Yellow!

8
00:00:41.711 --> 00:00:45.211
Green! Say it with me. Green!

9
00:00:49.206 --> 00:00:52.256
Pink! Say it with me. Pink!

10
00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:59.620
Black! Say it with me. Black!

11
00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:06.760
Point to red!

12
00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:10.029
Point to blue!

13
00:01:10.079 --> 00:01:13.363
Point to yellow!

14
00:01:13.413 --> 00:01:14.563
Good job!

15
00:01:15.555 --> 00:01:17.007
What colour is it?

16
00:01:17.057 --> 00:01:17.928
It's red!

17
00:01:17.978 --> 00:01:19.865
Yes! It's red!

18
00:01:21.252 --> 00:01:25.778
What colour is it?

19
00:01:25.828 --> 00:01:26.978
It's green!

20
00:01:28.045 --> 00:01:34.061
This is C. C is for cat. Cat! C is for cup. Cup!

21
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:45.252
Colour hunt! Find something red at home!

22
00:01:45.302 --> 00:01:50.948
Find something blue!

23
00:01:50.998 --> 00:01:52.148
Great!

24
00:01:52.975 --> 00:02:00.021
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

25
00:02:00.071 --> 00:02:01.700
Bye-bye, friends!

